    answer: "<p>Most Madison homes can be completed in a single day — typically 4-6 hours for a standard installation. We bring our portable gutter machine to your home and fabricate the gutters on-site, which means no waiting for materials to be shipped. Larger homes or those requiring fascia repair may take a bit longer.</p>"
  - question: What sizes of seamless gutters are available?
